#  original data, original handlers, original UI all remain intact. Everything
#  below is layered on top via monkey-patching and post-init handler hooks.
#
#  Features
#    1.  /auction <card_id> <start_price> [buy_now]   → list a card for auction
#    2.  Bid system   — minimum increment, highest-bid display
#    3.  Buy-Now      — instant settlement
#    4.  Auction Timer — 6h / 12h / 24h / 48h chosen via inline buttons
#    5.  Auto-Transfer — card → winner, diamonds → seller, atomically
#    6.  5% Auction Tax — auto-DM to /setb receiver
#    7.  Cancel rule — only when 0 bids
#    8.  Anti-Scam   — auctioned card locked from trade/sell/gift/delete
#    9.  Premium UI  — Bold Unicode titles, monospaced data lines
#   10.  /auctions    → list active auctions
#   11.  /myauctions  → seller view: Selling / Sold / Expired
#   12.  Watch system — subscribers get end-soon notification
#   13.  Live bid announcements in the group
#   14.  Persistent DB inside bot.data['auctions']
#   15.  Diamonds-only economy (uses user_profiles[uid]['kakera'])
#
#  Extra fixes requested:
#    • /wa command is REMOVED (no-op handler registered at the highest priority).
#    • /dpay is left INTACT.
